    - target: {fileID: 8439490232393766861, guid: 2e6185c7e5dbb4c4989dcb38e25cdcb4, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogue.sentences.Array.data[0]'
      value: 'Everyone! If I may have your attention! '
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8439490232393766861, guid: 2e6185c7e5dbb4c4989dcb38e25cdcb4, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogue.sentences.Array.data[1]'
      value: I am pleased to announce that we have a new recipe we will be sharing
        today! Our celebrity guest here will be trying the first bite of the day!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8439490232393766861, guid: 2e6185c7e5dbb4c4989dcb38e25cdcb4, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogue.sentences.Array.data[2]'
      value: We can assure you that it is the best thing you will ever taste! Enough
        to satisfy your families for generations!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8439490232393766861, guid: 2e6185c7e5dbb4c4989dcb38e25cdcb4, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogue.sentences.Array.data[3]'
      value: "We can assure you that it is the best \r\nthing you will ever taste!
        Enough to satisfy your families for generations!"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
