    name: Liezel
    soundToPlay: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 3eb1024c55ce8430ba259a61060f08e3, type: 3}
    audioPitchOffset: 0
    font: {fileID: 0}
    textSpeed: 0.024
    textPunctSpeed: 0.18
    lettersUntilSFX: 3
    sentences:
    - "... The <b>Locked Safe with Arrows</b>. It must be. The phrase must be applicable
      to Se\xF1or Rommel\u2019s belongings."
    - "Santi, if you are able, see if that phrase would be of use in the museum.
      Meanwhile, I have to find out if this connects to anything in Se\xF1or Rommel\u2019s
      house, which I hope it is."
