    - target: {fileID: 5654484641697981369, guid: 0d0aec03b4a2e4eebac4d306d494957c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogue.sentences.Array.data[0]'
      value: 'Hm..? This is really old.

'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5654484641697981369, guid: 0d0aec03b4a2e4eebac4d306d494957c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogue.sentences.Array.data[1]'
      value: <i>(It looks like a community event was supposed to be held at the <b>town
        hall</b>.)</i>
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5654484641697981369, guid: 0d0aec03b4a2e4eebac4d306d494957c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogue.sentences.Array.data[2]'
      value: <i>(Never heard of this one before. Seems no one cares at all.)</i>
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5654484641697981369, guid: 0d0aec03b4a2e4eebac4d306d494957c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogue.sentences.Array.data[3]'
      value: <i>(Oh, maybe I can mail them to recover this tradition, once this is
        all over.)</i>
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5654484641697981369, guid: 0d0aec03b4a2e4eebac4d306d494957c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogue.sentences.Array.data[4]'
      value: <i>(Just need to know their <b>address</b>.)</i>
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
