  dialogue:
    character: {fileID: 216368989601859519, guid: 5d7a500b15e65d3499df83ac5f56ef87, type: 3}
    character2: {fileID: -3387389256237283611, guid: 4c74d9b45011c0a4cb33179b186c1f73, type: 3}
    name: Liezel
    soundToPlay: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 1cfd43b09479e4b35a0341f36b492e9b, type: 3}
    audioPitchOffset: 0
    font: {fileID: 0}
    textSpeed: 0.022
    textPunctSpeed: 0.18
    lettersUntilSFX: 3
    sentences:
    - <SFX_liezel_wondering>Indeed. My sister Lorena is a genius in the mystic arts,
      but she is a researcher at heart. This manuscript was her collection of notes,
      according to her.
    - My family is one of katalonans. Magic runs deep in our blood.
    - My sister in particular was the type to go on and on about how magic should
      be used to benefit our communities.
    - <SFX_liezel_happy>Between the two of us, she was more talented in the practice.
      I have always preferred my job as a writer.
